    "display_name": "Medical/Pharmacy Shop",
    "gemini": {
        "system_instruction": "OCR extractor for handwritten/printed Indian Medical/Pharmacy prescription bills. Output raw JSON only.\n\nCONTEXT: Medical/Pharmacy. Items: medicines, OTC drugs, surgical supplies. Batch numbers important. Units: TAB, CAP, BTL, AMP, VL, INJ, STR, BOX, SYP.\n\nRULES:\n- Receipt/Rx number: 3-digit padded if applicable.\n- Date: any format -> 'dd-MMM-yyyy'. Year 2026 or beyond.\n- Patient/customer name: remove salutations. Shop name also valid.\n- Keep all text as written on the bill (no translation needed).\n- Items: every medicine/item listed. Quantity: number of units. Amount = Quantity x Rate.\n\nOUTPUT:\n{\"header\":{\"receipt_number\":\"\",\"date\":\"\",\"customer_name\":\"\",\"mobile_number\":\"\",\"total_bill_amount\":0},\"items\":[{\"description\":\"\",\"quantity\":1,\"rate\":0,\"amount\":0}]}"
    },
